  unitName: Holy Knight Will
  unitId: 50113
  unitNumber: 166
  description: A knight from the ruined La Veda Republic. He resisted the world's
    destruction until the very end. He is excellent at the sword, and great as a
    commander. His tactics steadily wore down his enemies. Deeply trusted by his
    soldiers, after a soldier proclaimed, "I know not if he's stronger than Atro,
    but he is most definitely more overwhelming!" he harshly rebuked that soldier.
  summonDesc: This light... Who are you?<br>I swear by my sword that I will save
    the world. Let's go!
  fusionDesc: We need strength to save<br>the world. I feel very <br>strongly about
    that.
  evoDesc: My sword is full of light!<br>This is evolution!
  element: 5
  rarity: 3
